@model ScanRecord
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Smart URL Scanner"; }
<section class="hero hero-home"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span> YOUR EVERYDAY LINK SAFETY TOOL</div><h1>Curiosity is good.<br/><em>Click carefully.</em></h1><p class="hero-lead">Check a link for common warning signs before you visit. Simple, explainable checks to help you make a smarter decision online.</p><div class="trust-row"><span>✳ Rule-based checks</span><span>✳ No paid AI required</span><span>✳ Learn as you scan</span></div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="art-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="art-orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="shield-illustration"><div class="shield-glow"></div><svg viewBox="0 0 180 200" role="img" aria-label="Shield security illustration"><path d="M90 12 L151 36 V88 C151 128 125 160 90 183 C55 160 29 128 29 88 V36 Z" fill="#f8e4cc" stroke="#b65f3b" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M90 28 L136 46 V88 C136 118 117 144 90 163 C63 144 44 118 44 88 V46 Z" fill="#fffaf4"/><path d="M65 96 L82 113 L116 75" fill="none" stroke="#294c43" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><div class="floating-card float-top"><span class="mini-icon green">✓</span><div><b>Stay one step ahead</b><small>Check before you click</small></div></div><div class="floating-card float-bottom"><span class="mini-icon peach">⌁</span><div><b>Risk signals</b><small>Understand the why</small></div></div><span class="spark spark-a">✳</span><span class="spark spark-b">✦</span></div></section>
<section class="scanner-wrap" id="scanner"><div class="scanner-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE LINK CHECK</span><h2>Got a link? <em>Let's look closer.</em></h2><p>Paste a full URL below. We’ll check it for common suspicious patterns.</p></div><span class="scan-stamp">01 <i>/ 03</i></span></div>
<form asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Scan" method="post" class="scan-form"><label asp-for="Url">Website URL</label><div class="url-input-wrap"><span class="url-icon">↗</span><input asp-for="Url" type="url" placeholder="https://example.com/page" autocomplete="url" required/><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Scan link <span>→</span></button></div><span asp-validation-for="Url" class="field-error"></span><div class="form-foot"><span>♧ Your scan is saved to your local project database.</span><span>Try a demo: <button type="button" class="text-button" onclick="setDemo('http://verify-account-free-prize.example.com/login')">suspicious example</button></span></div></form></section>
<section class="how-section"><div class="section-intro"><span class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</span><h2>Three steps to a <em>smarter click.</em></h2><p>No mystery scores. Just practical signals and clear explanations.</p></div><div class="step-grid"><article class="step-card"><span class="step-num">01</span><div class="step-icon peach-bg">↗</div><h3>Paste the link</h3><p>Enter the URL you received in a message, email, or post.</p></article><article class="step-card"><span class="step-num">02</span><div class="step-icon green-bg">⌕</div><h3>Check the signals</h3><p>Rule-based checks look for patterns such as HTTP, odd domains and suspicious wording.</p></article><article class="step-card"><span class="step-num">03</span><div class="step-icon yellow-bg">✳</div><h3>Make an informed choice</h3><p>Review the score, read the reasons, and verify the destination independently.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="bottom-cta"><div><span class="eyebrow">BUILD YOUR AWARENESS</span><h2>Small checks. <em>Safer habits.</em></h2><p>Learn how common online threats work in our quick-read safety library.</p></div><a class="btn btn-dark" asp-controller="Threats" asp-action="Index">Explore threat library ↗</a></section>

